Statement {#sec3}
=========

Content analysis {#s2-5}
----------------

The content of each transcript will be analysed independently by two raters with a professional training and previous experience in this field (Hodges and Wittenberg, [@B18]). An inductive content analysis will be applied, where the content of each written text is analysed by applying a set of predefined criteria. Text-content will be analysed by one researcher who has analysed and assigned meaning to similar text in the previous year.

 (Refs. 1,2,3,4 are examples)

